Z||000006||rogergarrison||01-30-2001||08:11 AM||||amonia and water works fine for most, lots of rubbing. Id never use scotchbrite, i sand cars for paint with them. A guy I know used water and scotchbrite to clean bugs off the leading edge of his planes wings. Cost him $2000 to get them repainted.||||reg||1
Z||000007||overlord||01-30-2001||09:12 AM||||i used ammonia....but then i tried GOO GONE......use the GOO GONE. although my tint was only on for 6 months.||||reg||1
